WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.124
Click Create campaign

00:00:04.124 --> 00:00:07.402
Enter a campaign name

00:00:07.402 --> 00:00:12.243
Keep Assistant and select your agent

00:00:12.243 --> 00:00:15.520
Upload your calling list (CSV)

00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:19.803
Map each variable to a CSV column

00:00:19.803 --> 00:00:23.385
Click Next to upload and verify the list

00:00:23.385 --> 00:00:24.486
Verified: step 2 opens

00:00:24.486 --> 00:00:31.267
Pick numbers, or switch to Number pool

00:00:31.267 --> 00:00:35.117
Set the timezone, start and end date & time

00:00:35.117 --> 00:00:42.920
Edit the calling windows, e.g. Mon–Sat only

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:47.599
Set the retry count and cooldown period

00:00:47.599 --> 00:00:49.474
Choose who gets email notifications

00:00:49.474 --> 00:00:52.575
Click Create campaign

00:00:52.575 --> 00:00:55.183
The campaign appears on the campaigns list
